        {
          "text": "Yawe akonkomeshe Aroni shimapepo ukuya pa mulu wa lupili lwa Holi, epo aile fwila pa bushiku bwakutampa umweshi walenga isano, mu mwaka walenga amakumi yane apo abena Israeli bafumine ku Egupto. ",
